completed_at: "2026-09-05T04:18:40.766Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "pm release gains an ergonomic path to also reset status (flag such as --reopen/--status open, or at minimum a one-line hint that the item remains in_progress and unclaimed); pause-task alias behavior is referenced as the existing combined spelling; MCP pm_release mirrors the option; docs + linked tests; default behavior unchanged"
parent: pm-dj98
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Added stable released_unclaimed_in_progress warning and concrete pause-task guidance to the SDK ownership-release result shared by CLI and MCP.
expected_result: Release preserves status and reports the remaining in-progress state; pause-task performs the explicit combined handoff.
